a16z-mercury-banking-for-startups:greenh.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p&gt;In 1488, a thirteen-year-old named Michelangelo entered the Florence workshop of Domenico Ghirlandaio as an apprentice. Ghirlandaio was the most sought-after fresco painter in the city, not because he worked alone, but because he didn’t. His bottega was built around a precise division of attention: Ghirlandaio established the composition, the figures, the light. Trusted collaborators carried the work forward, applying the final glazes, rendering the faces, bringing the surface to life. The paintings you see today in Santa Maria Novella are the product of both. You can’t tell where one ends and the other begins. That was the point.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Top of Funnel team owns the introduction to a company that believes design is how you show people you take them seriously. We’re looking for a Senior Design Engineer who works the way Ghirlandaio’s bottega did: close enough to the creative process to carry it forward, and skilled enough to know the difference between almost right and actually right.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be joining a product-led growth team that works across the logged out &lt;a href=&quot;http://mercury.com&quot;&gt;Mercury.com&lt;/a&gt; site, supporting stakeholders across the organization that want to share something with the world.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring design intent to life.&lt;/strong&gt; Our brand designers work at high velocity, producing considered, high-fidelity layouts. Your job is to carry that work forward, with enough taste to honor the intention and enough craft to make it feel native to the web.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring the web platform to the table, not just the design spec.&lt;/strong&gt; You’ll surface what’s newly possible in browsers, propose enhancements that design didn’t know to ask for, and advocate for approaches that make experiences feel alive rather than translated from a static file.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Implement animation and interaction that earns attention.&lt;/strong&gt; Product launches, campaign pages, and editorial moments require more than accurate layouts. They require pacing, motion, and detail; you’ll own that layer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and extend the design system.&lt;/strong&gt; The web site’s design system is both the guardrail and the creative toolbox. You’ll identify when a component needs to stretch to cover a new use case, and build those extensions in a way that fits rather than fights the system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work directly with brand designers and marketing as a peer.&lt;/strong&gt; This isn’t an execution role, it’s a creative partner role. You’ll be in the room during concepting, not just receiving tickets at the end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set the quality bar for Mercury’s front door.&lt;/strong&gt; You’ll have a point of view about what exceptional looks like on the web, and the mandate to advocate for it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The ideal candidate:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has a portfolio of crafted work that demonstrates both engineering quality and design sensibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has been the technical lead of complex projects with many stakeholders with a track record of success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has deep command of HTML and CSS as a creative medium, not just a layout tool. You know what the platform can do and you stay current on what’s new&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is fluent in the web animation stack — from CSS transitions to GSAP to the Web Animations API — and knows which tool fits which problem. Understands that motion on the web is a performance concern as much as a design one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is proficient in React and Next.js, particularly in a content-heavy, pre-rendered marketing context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has experience working within and extending a design system, with pragmatic opinions about when to use what’s there vs. when to build something new.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has worked closely with brand designers or creative directors in previous roles and knows how to navigate strong design opinions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cares about performance as an extension of craft: a slow or janky interaction isn’t just a technical problem, it’s a design failure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has experience with DatoCMS or a comparable headless CMS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this role interests you, we invite you to explore our public demo at &lt;a href=&quot;https://demo.mercury.com/&quot;&gt;demo.mercury.com&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The total rewards package at Mercury includes base salary, equity (stock options/RSUs), and benefits. Our salary and equity ranges are highly competitive within the SaaS and fintech industry and are updated regularly using the most reliable compensation survey data for our industry. New hire offers are made based on a candidate’s experience, expertise, geographic location, and internal pay equity relative to peers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our target new hire base salary ranges for this role are the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;US employees (any location): $166,600 - $208,300&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Canadian employees (any location): CAD 157,400 - 196,800&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mercury values diversity &amp;amp; belonging and is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer. All individuals seeking employment at Mercury are considered without regard to race, color, religion, national origin, age, sex, marital status, ancestry, physical or mental disability, veteran status, gender identity, sexual orientation, or any other legally protected characteristic. We are committed to providing reasonable accommodations throughout the recruitment process for applicants with disabilities or special needs. If you need assistance, or an accommodation, please let your recruiter know once you are contacted about a role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-ME1&lt;/p&gt;

a16z-pindrop-security:greenhouse:7773069.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pindrop is the Real Human + Right Human® Identity Trust Platform for the AI era. As AI-driven fraud and deepfakes erode trust in digital communication, Pindrop delivers continuous identity verification and deepfake detection across voice, video, and digital interactions in real time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Enterprises rely on Pindrop to secure billions of high-risk customer interactions each year, including top U.S. banks, as well as leading insurers and healthcare providers. Powered by models trained on more than 1.5 billion real-world interactions annually and protected by 300+ patents, Pindrop restores trust while reducing fraud, lowering operational costs, and improving customer experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Recognized by TIME as one of the Top 10 Most Influential Software Companies of 2026 and by Inc. for Best in Business for Innovation, Pindrop is backed by leading investors including Andreessen Horowitz, IVP, and CapitalG.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll do&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pindrop is looking for a high-performing Senior Platform Product Manager to drive strategy and development for the Pindrop Platform — the shared foundation that powers our products (Protect, Passport, and Pulse) and a set of platform capabilities exposed directly to customers, such as Pindrop Intelligence. You’ll ensure that our platform is scalable, reliable, easy to build on, and delivers differentiated value both to internal product teams and to customers consuming platform features directly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Market analysis &amp;amp; customer insight&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay ahead of competitive and industry trends in platforms, data products, and developer ecosystems.Partner with Product and GTM teams to understand how Protect, Passport, Pulse and other product lines depend on the Pindrop Platform today and what they will need next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regularly engage with customers and partners who consume platform capabilities (e.g., Pindrop Intelligence APIs, data services) to understand use cases, workflows, and unmet needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage organization goals, business metrics, and KPIs for the platform, including adoption, reliability, performance, and developer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate internal and external steering forums to align stakeholders on priorities and investments for the platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Vision &amp;amp; roadmap for the Pindrop Platform&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the overall vision, strategy, and success measures for the Pindrop Platform as a product in its own right.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define how shared platform capabilities (data, AI/ML services, APIs, integrations, observability, security, entitlements, and configuration) evolve to support Protect, Passport, Pulse and future products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and maintain prioritized platform roadmaps, balancing foundational investments (scalability, reliability, security, cost efficiency) with new capabilities and externalized features like Pindrop Intelligence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clear user and system narratives that describe how internal product teams, and end customers will interact with Pindrop Platform capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define, document, and communicate objectives, requirements, and constraints for platform initiatives and releases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with executive and cross-functional stakeholders to obtain buy-in, make tradeoffs, and raise escalations when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Execution &amp;amp; delivery&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive end-to-end execution for platform initiatives, from discovery and design through delivery and launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with engineering and engineering leadership to design and deliver high-quality, continuous releases of platform services, APIs, and data products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage platform capabilities across their lifecycle, from initial MVPs to scaled, hardened services adopted across multiple products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate new technology from research and product teams into the platform in a way that is reusable, well-abstracted, and easy to adopt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with go-to-market partners to position platform capabilities (such as Pindrop Intelligence) and accelerate customer adoption and time to value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with marketing to set positioning and develop market-facing materials, demos, and content for platform features where they are directly consumed by customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow platform adoption and influence by assisting Sales, Customer Success, and Solutions Engineering with identifying key customer segments, building pipeline, and closing opportunities where platform capabilities are a differentiator.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are passionate about &lt;strong&gt;platforms&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;APIs&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;developer experiences&lt;/strong&gt;, and you understand how strong platform strategy accelerates product teams and unlocks new customer value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You care deeply about security, reliability, and performance, and you are comfortable working in a space that spans voice, identity, fraud, and AI/ML-powered intelligence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a high degree of integrity and trustworthiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a strong sense of personal ownership and responsibility in accomplishing the organization’s goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are entrepreneurial with a high level of energy, dedication, and an unrelenting drive to succeed and win.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are resilient in the face of challenges, change, and ambiguity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are optimistic and believe that you can make a problem into a solution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are resourceful, excited to uncover innovative solutions and teach yourself something new when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You take accountability, do the things you say you’ll do, under-promise and over-deliver.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are nimble and adaptable when priorities change and continue to see the “forest through the trees”.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your skill-set&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5–7 years of product management experience in B2B SaaS, with significant time spent on platform, infrastructure, or shared services (e.g., data platforms, API platforms, developer platforms, or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with cloud-native architectures and highly distributed systems; familiarity with how platform decisions impact reliability, performance, cost, and security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience &lt;strong&gt;defining and executing go-to-market strategy&lt;/strong&gt; for platform or API / data products, including positioning, packaging, pricing, and launch planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to partner closely with &lt;strong&gt;Sales, Marketing, Customer Success, and Solutions Engineering&lt;/strong&gt; to translate platform capabilities into clear value propositions, customer narratives, and enablement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience creating and scaling internal platforms that serve multiple product teams or business units, OR externalized platforms / APIs used directly by customers and partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical background or strong technical fluency; you can work closely with engineering on APIs, data models, integration patterns, and system tradeoffs would be a big plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience within a SaaS company required; experience in security, identity, fraud, or risk is a plus but not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of &lt;strong&gt;successful product or platform launches&lt;/strong&gt; and meaningful impact on adoption, usage, or business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable rolling up your sleeves to dig into details, understand edge cases, or help unblock teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong leadership and communication skills — you can bring clarity to complex technical topics and drive alignment across engineering, product, GTM, and executive stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transparent and open about what works and what doesn’t; you use data and feedback to iterate quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Within 30 days, you’ll&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complete onboarding and understand Pindrop as a product portfolio and the voice security space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn the core capabilities of the Pindrop Platform and how Protect, Passport, and Pulse are built on top of it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meet your key partners across Product, Platform Engineering, Protect/Passport/Pulse teams, Sales, Marketing, Customer Success, and Solutions Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review existing platform roadmaps, customer feedback, and GTM materials for platform features (including Pindrop Intelligence).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Within 60 days, you’ll&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Refine and socialize a clear problem/opportunity framing for your initial focus areas on the Pindrop Platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and update a portion of the platform roadmap, aligning it with product needs and GTM priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead discovery with internal product teams and select customers/partners to validate requirements for upcoming platform initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with GTM partners to shape positioning, messaging, and launch plans for at least one upcoming platform or Pindrop Intelligence enhancement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Within 90 days, you’ll&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fully own a meaningful slice of the Pindrop Platform roadmap and associated KPIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive at least one platform initiative from definition through execution, partnering closely with engineering and GTM teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish lightweight rituals (reviews, steering, reporting) that bring clarity to platform priorities, tradeoffs, and status.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and propose medium-term platform and GTM bets that can unlock new value for products and customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Pindropper, you join a rapidly growing company making technology more human with the power of voice. You will work alongside some of the best and brightest. We’re a passionate group committed to excellence - but that doesn’t stop us from enjoying the journey as a team with chess and poker tournaments, catered lunches and happy hours, wellness programming, and more. Because we take our jobs seriously, we add in time for rest with Unlimited PTO, Focus Thursday, and Company-wide Rest Days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of Pindrop, you’ll directly influence our products and contribute to shaping the future of voice security. We invest in great people and support them with great benefits:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation, including equity for all employees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited Paid Time Off (PTO)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote-first culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This position is contracted through Alcor BPO.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Not sure if this is you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We want a diverse, global team, with a broad range of experience and perspectives. If this job sounds great, but you’re not sure if you qualify, apply anyway! We carefully consider every application and will either move forward with you, find another team that might be a better fit, keep in touch for future opportunities, or thank you for your time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI - A Transformative Force&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Pindrop, we view artificial intelligence as a transformative force that, when harnessed responsibly, can unlock unprecedented value for our customers, partners and society and enable and empower us to continue to deliver cutting-edge technology to combat fraud and unblur the lines between what it means to be human versus machine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pindrop may use AI tools to help prioritize job applications for human review. The AI tool may analyze your work experience and skills to assess fit for the role, but does not consider your name or contact details. Applications with the strongest match to job requirements are prioritized for human review; not all applications may be individually reviewed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pindrop is an Equal Opportunity Employer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here at Pindrop, it is our mission to create and maintain a diverse and inclusive work environment. As an equal opportunity employer, all qualified applicants receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, age, religion, sex, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin, genetic information, disability, marital and/or veteran status.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

a16z-senra-systems:greenhouse:5151291008.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At Senra Systems, we believe that the future of manufacturing lies not in automation, but in configuration.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We supercharge electrical wire harness manufacturing through software configuration, transforming skilled assembly tasks into high-throughput production lines. We enable customers to design what they want, when they want it and deliver harness builds at record-breaking speed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As a Lead Technician, you will be the 1st line of defense for technical troubleshooting on the production floor. You will guide a small team of technicians to build high-quality, mission-critical components that power&amp;nbsp;cutting-edge&amp;nbsp;aerospace and defense systems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will organize, support, and drive the team to meet the highest industry standards for safety, quality, and efficiency. This role is ideal for a hands-on, organized leader with a passion for building electrical hardware and continuously improving floor operations. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll own:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Autonomously build electrical harness assemblies for aerospace and defense customers &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Responsible for keeping the floor on track – provide technical and operational direction to team members to ensure quality standards and schedule are met.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This may include: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Demonstrating proper techniques to new apprentice technicians &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Inspecting hardware in-process to ensure conformance to specifications &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Implementing daily task checklists to&amp;nbsp;maintain&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;workcenter &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Assign and prioritize daily work per production schedule.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Communicate work plan &amp;amp; work completed to team &amp;amp; operations stakeholders to minimize interruptions and ensure continuity. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Work cross-functionally to ensure adequate support for nominal production operations  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Foster a culture of collaboration with Manufacturing, Quality, and Logistics to enhance manufacturability, streamline processes, and ensure seamless output to customers.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring to the team:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;High school diploma or equivalent certification and 3+ years as a technician in a fast-paced production environment.   &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Proficient in reading complex wire harness schematics and&amp;nbsp;determining&amp;nbsp;proper order of operations &amp;amp; relevant techniques. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Knowledge of soldering, wire stripping, contact crimping, contact insertion and removal, harness routing and strain relief techniques is&amp;nbsp;required. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strong problem-solving and decision-making skills. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Proficiency&amp;nbsp;with ERP/MRP systems, work order management, and BOM structures. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Excellent communication skills, with the ability to engage cross-functional teams and present key performance data to leadership. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Passion for innovation and continuous improvement, with a hands-on approach to solving complex manufacturing challenges. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Adaptable, detail-oriented, and proactive with&amp;nbsp;a strong sense&amp;nbsp;of ownership. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Must be willing to work overtime and weekends as needed &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Must be able to&amp;nbsp;lift up&amp;nbsp;to 25 lbs. unassisted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Must be able to stand for extended periods - 8 hours minimum&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
