&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;2+ years of leadership experience, preferably within a manufacturing production environment.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;1+ year of scheduling and task allocation experience. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Familiarity with IPC-620 or NASA STD 8739.4. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Has worked at a contract manufacturing company &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation: &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compensation will be based on experience, qualifications, and other job-related factors. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hourly Range: $30.00- $50.00&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This is an onsite role at our facility in Cypress, CA.&amp;nbsp;  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits: &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unmatched opportunities to drive impact on a friendly and mission-driven team &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a piece of the pie with equity participation!  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive medical, dental, vision, life and long-term disability coverage &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Spending Account (FSA) and Dependent Spending Account (DSA) for health-related expenses &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;20 vacation days per year and 12 company holidays for rest and relaxation&lt;/li&gt;
