&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Must have experience with clinician or MD licensing in multiple states&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Must have proficient knowledge of TJC Behavioral Health and HIPAA Standards&lt;/li&gt;
