&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Possesses proactive mindset and shows strong ability to take initiative&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strong interpersonal, relationship-building and listening skills, with a natural, consultative style&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Ability to energize, communicate, and build rapport at all levels within an organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strong project management skills, with a demonstrable ability to corral and manage details in a fast-paced, fluid environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Ability to work quickly and efficiently while maintaining accuracy&lt;/li&gt;
